  {
   "id": "two-point-hospital-82117@post-2023-12-18",
   "gameId": "two-point-hospital-82117",
   "displayName": "Two Point Ho Ho Ho-spital | Jingle Jim Jams Available for all!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-18T11:25:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Heya Scrubs!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To welcome you into the festive season, we all know you've been wishing for some long-lost exclusives to make a comeback. Well, we're here with a festive treat, you can now dress your staff as the Great Man himself!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Jingle Jimjams are now available for all those who missed them in their original release, as a jolly staff customisation option, you can dress all of your staff (or just your favourites!) in the best present-transporter's garb.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Plus, just in case you didn't know, there's a bulging sack full of festive goodies in-game for you to bring a merry festivity to your builds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As it is the season of giving, thirdly, did you miss out on the old Superbug initiative items or Hospital Pass pack? Well, worry no more! All you have to do is sign up to our community forums, head on over to the reward section and link your Steam account to claim ALL of the Superbug Season One items all bundled up for you, along with the Golden Toilet Suit. Ravishing! (Lavishing?)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, keep an eye peeled for festive steals coming up soon, if you're looking to play any of our titles or DLCs and are waiting for a sale!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Love,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Two Point Team <3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
